   "id": "241a98011f45",
   "unit_id": "241a98011f45ca1a27341613029636ab22d2cb1f3da83da574c89eb009d0fd20",
   "revision_key": "5d43dd66f42f4a90b3e6d45801eb3cb141cd406d231d629378f2f533c9dacf20",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 41782,
   "section": "mod-tome/dialogs/GameOptions.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Forces the game to save each level instead of each zone.\nThis makes it save more often but the game will use less memory when deep in a dungeon.\n\n#LIGHT_RED#Changing this option will not affect already visited zones.\n*THIS DOES NOT MAKE A FULL SAVE EACH LEVEL*.\n#LIGHT_RED#Disabling it is not recommended#WHITE#",
   "target": "强制游戏按地图层而非按区域保存。\n这会增加存档次数，但在深入地下城时占用更少内存。\n\n#LIGHT_RED#更改此选项不会影响已访问过的区域。\n*注意：并不会在每一层完整存档！*\n#LIGHT_RED#不建议关闭。#WHITE#",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/dialogs/GameOptions.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    706
   ],
   "previously_reviewed": {
    "A": true,
    "B": true
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "d4b76030adb8",
   "unit_id": "d4b76030adb8f95af89206a984fb945afc3fa90823e15acee5c2a40159ab05f2",
   "revision_key": "15ec81a65992ea0b898034588a7043f6d7976e7455995b69d05f586d88993356",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 41911,
   "section": "mod-tome/dialogs/LevelupDialog.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Talent category points allow you to either:\n- learn a new talent (class or generic) category\n- improve a known talent category efficiency by 0.2\n- learn a new inscription slot (up to a maximum of 5, learning it is automatic when using an inscription)\n\nYou gain a new point at level 10, 20 and 34.\nSome races or items may increase them as well.",
   "target": "技能树解锁点有以下作用：\n- 解锁职业或通用技能树\n- 提升已解锁技能树的精通度，每点提升 0.2\n- 解锁新的刻印位（最多 5 个，你使用刻印时会自动消耗点数解锁）\n\n你会在人物等级达到 10、20 和 34 级时各获得 1 个点数。\n某些种族和物品可以获得额外的点数。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/dialogs/LevelupDialog.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    650
   ],
   "previously_reviewed": {
    "A": false,
    "B": false
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "ff80c6c7ccca",
   "unit_id": "ff80c6c7cccaf437c1b90332da76c441daf91b16adafedbccb3f72d969021b33",
   "revision_key": "dadd2e30210930e4ecf94471102b9745bdedca6bb525e0d7828c49d3dd8b4b95",
