   "translation_line": 41924,
   "section": "mod-tome/dialogs/LevelupDialog.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Prodigies are special talents that only the most powerful of characters can attain.\nAll of them require at least 50 in a core stat and many also have more special demands. You can learn a new prodigy at level 25 and 42.",
   "target": "觉醒技是角色足够强大时才能获得的特殊技能。\n所有觉醒技都要求某项核心属性达到 50 点，其中许多还有更特殊的额外要求。\n你可以在人物等级达到 25 级和 42 级时各获得一个觉醒技能点。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/dialogs/LevelupDialog.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    658
   ],
   "previously_reviewed": {
    "A": false,
    "B": false
   }
  },
